    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d668">

                <pb facs="0960" n="950" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg950"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/7–2845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hurley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-28">July 28, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please deliver as soon as possible the following message to Dr. Soong: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>I understand you were to communicate with Marshal Stalin by 30th or 31st
                            July. I think it important that before that date you communicate with
                            him here through Moscow requesting opportunity to return to Moscow and
                            continue discussions in hope of reaching agreement.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
